{"id":"en_from-lizard-to-dragon-lord","title":"FROM LIZARD TO DRAGON LORD","titleEn":"FROM LIZARD TO DRAGON LORD","description":"Arya carries the Beast King's bloodline and finds herself reborn at the crucial Beast Selection Ceremony. She remembers the misery of her previous life, when her sister Selena—who likewise recalls the past—employed the same schemes to take Shadow, the Dragon Prince destined for Arya. This time Arya is determined to rewrite what is to come. Lieyan, heir to the Phoenix clan, offers Arya his allegiance willingly, and Shadow, though positioned at Selena's side, covertly assists her. Unable to capture Shadow's affection, Selena makes common cause with the Demon race in pursuit of power. Arya locates the Seal of the Dragon Soul, shatters it, frees Shadow from his binding, and ends the forced contract. In the Great Beast War she unites the two divine beasts to defeat the demons' scheme and bring ","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/from-lizard-to-dragon-lord/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/from-lizard-to-dragon-lord/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Rebirth","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7ony/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_from-lizard-to-dragon-lord_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7ony/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_from-lizard-to-dragon-lord_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d7ony/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_from-lizard-to-dragon-lord_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url"